    "product_additional_6qctTT": {
      "type": "product-additional",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_BeR9XE": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Overview",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>If you thought our custom pillows couldn’t get any better, they just did. Introducing three trim options, from a pop of piping to playful pom pom. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"/collections/pillow-trim-samples\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pillow Trim Samples\">Pillow Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/PillowTrimArrangement_52b06631-172f-43e9-8d6c-e2dc101903b9.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Moodboard-2.jpg"
          }
        },
        "tab_EgMHhD": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "PIPING",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>Add a pop of piping to your pillows. Crafted from luxurious velvets and cottons, our assortment of colors and patterns is suitable for any design scheme. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"/collections/pillow-trim-samples\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pillow Trim Samples\">Pillow Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-Piping.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Beatrice-KevinOGara_9b342053-04a0-465c-b7ee-4fc6ec940c14.jpg"
          }
        },
        "tab_fRXBwX": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FRINGE",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>Timeless texture that works well in both modern and classic spaces, these tastefully colorful fringes feel as good as they look.</p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"/collections/pillow-trim-samples\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pillow Trim Samples\">Pillow Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-Fringe.png",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Kevin-OGara-6_ab166462-7171-4e45-acaf-cd26b246dc37.png"
          }
        },
        "tab_eHCLjp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "POM POM",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>It’s soft, it’s sweet, it’s irresistible. We love pom pom trim for cozy spaces, especially a bedroom or nursery.</p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"/collections/pillow-trim-samples\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pillow Trim Samples\">Pillow Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-PomPom.png",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/PinkBed-CloseUp_6df056be-d576-4197-929d-35e998288e8f.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
