            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<h3>Monogram</h3><p>Our monogram style displays three initials with a larger center letter—use First, Last, Middle. For example, Anna Beatrice Clark is ACB.</p><h3>Text</h3><p>A name, date, or phrase—as long as it's 15 characters or less, you can choose any letter, number, or keyboard symbol.</p>",
